# MASTER PROMPT — BUILD AN ENTERPRISE HR KPI INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, enterprise SaaS engineer, HR analytics expert, data scientist, and professional UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, modern, production-oriented web application called:

**HR KPI Intelligence Platform**

The purpose of this platform is to transform HR Key Performance Indicator (KPI) reference documents into a fully functional, automated HR performance measurement, monitoring, and reporting system.

This must be a real working web application, not a static website or visual prototype.

The application should allow organizations to:

1. Import HR KPI reference files.
2. Extract and organize individual KPI definitions.
3. Convert each KPI into an interactive digital card.
4. Understand each KPI's purpose, definition, formula, and usage.
5. Enter the operational data required to calculate each KPI.
6. Calculate KPI values automatically using accurate formulas.
7. Monitor KPI performance through dashboards.
8. Define targets, thresholds, and performance expectations.
9. Generate scheduled weekly and monthly performance reports.
10. Analyze historical performance and identify trends.
11. Receive alerts when KPIs fall outside acceptable thresholds.
12. Manage multiple organizations, departments, and users.
13. Use AI to explain insights and recommend improvements.

Build this as an enterprise-ready, scalable SaaS platform suitable for HR departments, HR consultants, companies, and executive management.

